 in the students' shoes and relate when counselling the students, he has their utmost trust. Perhaps because of his gentle personality, he's also quite popular with the female students."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85402"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ed4ff848a12f8178571d4a46e7183e31d8c858f10f0802537f08390c47e6c11.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f669d09d43a4ed985d2a21232a089fc2ddf82edcc4e34b05e53deba1bfe0301.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森久保 祥太郎","creatorId":"vndb:s381","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s381","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s381","name":"森久保 祥太郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80593","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85403","characterName":"ゾラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85403"},"originalCharacterName":"ゾラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Oi, Teuta. I'm going shopping but do you wanna come? I'm going to go buy that chicken you love.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Teuta's deceased older brother, he was 22 at the time. He had a strong sense of justice and dreamed of becoming a police officer. Though he graduated from the police academy with excellent marks, the reality of the force was far from his ideals. As such, he temporarily left after having witnessed his colleagues' deaths, taking on brutal cases and being made to overlook corruption. He fell into a lifestyle of alcoholism and drug addiction, which led to him getting caught in a gang war and dying."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85403"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0a0aefd7a3016a26a10a4248903f70952681b8b4c1a3699747a2b3df88ee680.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/1394a4faff88f8604beda74fee44f755862087d3bff96cb7d73bedbd6c28ccae.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"武内 駿輔","creatorId":"vndb:s10963","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10963","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10963","name":"武内 駿輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80603","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85404","characterName":"マグダ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85404"},"originalCharacterName":"マグダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I've atoned for my crimes. I was a model prisoner and now I'm straight.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Belongs to the \"Black Hawk\" street gang in a district full of immigrants. She was imprisoned for theft and arson but is now released, returning to the Black Hawks. She has a rough personality but has a strong sense of fellowship."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85404"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1b627dd026c0f7105cccbc45656b6